{"title":"Downloads","type":"download","content":"<p>Paimon is released as a source artifact, and also through Maven.</p>\n<h2 id=\"source-releases\">Source Releases</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RELEASE</th>\n<th>DATE</th>\n<th>DOWNLOAD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2.1.0</td>\n<td>2026-10-12</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-2.1.0/apache-paimon-2.1.0-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a> (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-2.1.0/apache-paimon-2.1.0-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>, <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-2.1.0/apache-paimon-2.1.0-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0.0</td>\n<td>2026-08-07</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-2.0.0/apache-paimon-2.0.0-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-2.0.0/apache-paimon-2.0.0-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-2.0.0/apache-paimon-2.0.0-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.2</td>\n<td>2026-06-23</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-1.4.2/apache-paimon-1.4.2-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.4.2/apache-paimon-1.4.2-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.4.2/apache-paimon-1.4.2-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.1</td>\n<td>2026-04-27</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-1.4.1/apache-paimon-1.4.1-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.4.1/apache-paimon-1.4.1-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.4.1/apache-paimon-1.4.1-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.3.2</td>\n<td>2026-05-14</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-1.3.2/apache-paimon-1.3.2-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.3.2/apache-paimon-1.3.2-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.3.2/apache-paimon-1.3.2-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.2.0</td>\n<td>2025-07-16</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-1.2.0/apache-paimon-1.2.0-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.2.0/apache-paimon-1.2.0-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-1.2.0/apache-paimon-1.2.0-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>To download a source distribution for a particular release, click on the <em>tar</em> link.</p>\n<p>For security, hash and signature files are always hosted at <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">Apache</a>.</p>\n<p>All Paimon releases are available via <a href=\"https://archive.apache.org/dist/paimon/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"undefined\" rel=\"noopener\">https://archive.apache.org/dist/paimon/</a> including checksums and signatures.</p>\n<h2 id=\"pypaimon\">PyPaimon</h2><p>PyPaimon is released through PyPI:</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>pip install pypaimon<span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token number\">2.1</span><span class=\"token number\">.0</span></code></pre><p>The Apache source distribution is also available:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RELEASE</th>\n<th>DATE</th>\n<th>DOWNLOAD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2.1.0</td>\n<td>2026-10-12</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/pypaimon-2.1.0/pypaimon-2.1.0.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a> (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-2.1.0/pypaimon-2.1.0.tar.gz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>, <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-2.1.0/pypaimon-2.1.0.tar.gz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0.0</td>\n<td>2026-08-07</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/pypaimon-2.0.0/pypaimon-2.0.0.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-2.0.0/pypaimon-2.0.0.tar.gz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-2.0.0/pypaimon-2.0.0.tar.gz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.2</td>\n<td>2026-06-23</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/pypaimon-1.4.2/pypaimon-1.4.2.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a>               (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-1.4.2/pypaimon-1.4.2.tar.gz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>,                <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/pypaimon-1.4.2/pypaimon-1.4.2.tar.gz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"paimon-terraform\">Paimon Terraform</h2><p>The Paimon Terraform provider manages Paimon REST Catalog databases, tables, and access policies with Terraform and OpenTofu. It is published as <code>apache/paimon</code> to the <a href=\"https://search.opentofu.org/provider/apache/paimon/latest\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenTofu Registry</a>, and each <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/terraform-provider-paimon/releases\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub release</a> carries signed provider binaries:</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>terraform <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  required_providers <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    paimon <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      source  <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"apache/paimon\"</span>\n      version <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"0.1.0\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre><p>Until the provider is listed in the Terraform Registry, Terraform users can set <code>source = &quot;registry.opentofu.org/apache/paimon&quot;</code>.</p>\n<p>The Apache source distribution is also available:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RELEASE</th>\n<th>DATE</th>\n<th>DOWNLOAD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.1.0</td>\n<td>2026-10-21</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/paimon/paimon-terraform-0.1.0/apache-paimon-terraform-0.1.0-src.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">tar</a> (<a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-terraform-0.1.0/apache-paimon-terraform-0.1.0-src.tgz.sha512\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">digest</a>, <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/paimon-terraform-0.1.0/apache-paimon-terraform-0.1.0-src.tgz.asc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">pgp</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"verify-the-integrity-of-the-files\">Verify the Integrity of the Files</h2><p>Verify the SHA-512 checksum (.sha512) and PGP signature (.asc) of each downloaded source archive. For more information why this must be done, please read <a href=\"https://www.apache.org/info/verification.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">Verifying Apache Software Foundation Releases</a>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"verify-the-hash-digest\">Verify the hash digest</h3><p>We use SHA-512 to verify the hash digest of the file.</p>\n<p>To check a hash, you can first compute the SHA-512 checksum for the file you just downloaded, and then download the\ndigest file for comparison, they should be equal.</p>\n<p>Compute the checksum of your file:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Windows: certUtil -hashfile file SHA512</li>\n<li>Linux: sha512sum file</li>\n<li>Mac: shasum -a 512 file</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"verify-the-pgp-signature\">Verify the PGP signature</h3><p>To verify the signature using GPG or PGP, please do the following:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the release artifact and the corresponding PGP signature from the table above.</li>\n<li>Download the <a href=\"https://downloads.apache.org/paimon/KEYS\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"null\" rel=\"noopener\">Apache Paimon KEYS file</a>.</li>\n<li>Import the KEYS file and verify the downloaded artifact using one of the following methods:</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>gpg <span class=\"token operator\">--</span><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token constant\">KEYS</span>\ngpg <span class=\"token operator\">--</span>verify downloaded_file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>asc downloaded_file</code></pre><p>or</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>pgpk <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>a <span class=\"token constant\">KEYS</span>\npgpv downloaded_file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>asc</code></pre><p>or</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>pgp <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>ka <span class=\"token constant\">KEYS</span>\npgp downloaded_file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>asc</code></pre><h2 id=\"maven-artifacts\">Maven Artifacts</h2><p>Add the following to the dependencies section of your <code>pom.xml</code> file:</p>\n<h3 id=\"flink\">Flink</h3><p>Please replace <code>${flink.version}</code> in the following xml file to the version of Flink you&#39;re using. For example, <code>1.20</code>.</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>dependencies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>dependency</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>groupId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>org.apache.paimon<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>groupId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>artifactId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>paimon-flink-${flink.version}<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>artifactId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>version</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>2.1.0<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>version</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>dependency</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>dependencies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre><p>Also include <code>&lt;dependency&gt;</code> elements for any extension modules you need: <code>paimon-flink-cdc</code>, <code>paimon-flink-action</code>, and so forth.</p>\n<h3 id=\"spark\">Spark</h3><p>Replace <code>${spark.version}</code> with the Spark version you use and <code>${scala.binary.version}</code> with its Scala binary version. For example, use <code>3.5</code> and <code>2.12</code> for Spark 3.5, or <code>4.1</code> and <code>2.13</code> for Spark 4.1.</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>dependencies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>dependency</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>groupId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>org.apache.paimon<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>groupId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>artifactId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>paimon-spark-${spark.version}_${scala.binary.version}<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>artifactId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n        <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>version</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>2.1.0<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>version</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>dependency</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>dependencies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre>","toc":[{"depth":2,"text":"Source Releases","id":"source-releases"},{"depth":2,"text":"PyPaimon","id":"pypaimon"},{"depth":2,"text":"Paimon Terraform","id":"paimon-terraform"},{"depth":2,"text":"Verify the Integrity of the Files","id":"verify-the-integrity-of-the-files"},{"depth":3,"text":"Verify the hash digest","id":"verify-the-hash-digest"},{"depth":3,"text":"Verify the PGP signature","id":"verify-the-pgp-signature"},{"depth":2,"text":"Maven Artifacts","id":"maven-artifacts"},{"depth":3,"text":"Flink","id":"flink"},{"depth":3,"text":"Spark","id":"spark"}],"alias":"downloads"}